{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24500","headline":"老病相仍以诗自解 · 白居易","name":"老病相仍以诗自解","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣枯忧喜与彭殇，都是人间戏一场。\n虫臂鼠肝犹不怪，鸡肤鹤发复何伤。\n昨因风发甘长往，今遇阳和又小康。\n还似远行装束了，迟回且住亦何妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}